    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_623> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_623_obligation_0_37d5931b_role_026102ce4a> a dznorm:Role ;
