    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_786> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_786_obligation_0_456d3195_action_23b81aa01c> a dznorm:Action ;
