    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_967> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_967_condition_0_c4cc2377_role_a1a28bd79d> a dznorm:Role ;
