    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_999> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_999_obligation_0_051eee5f> a dznorm:Obligation ;
