    dzdoc:versionSourceArticle <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_765> ;
    dzdoc:versionSourceDocument <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#version_art_766_19750926_OpEnact_f17adf7c56> a dzdoc:ArticleVersion ;
