<https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#version_book_2_book_2_chp_9_book_2_chp_9_sec_1_bis_book_2_chp_9_sec_1_bis_subsec_3_art_6> a dzdoc:AmendmentEvent,
