        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_954>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_955>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_956>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_957>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1975-09-26/75-58#art_958>,
